  "about": "The robot drummer's proportions: the single source of truth for its joints,\nwritten to src/drums/drummer_spec.json by build_drummer.py (or on its own with\n`python tools/blender/build_drummer.py --spec-only`) and read by the runtime\n(src/drums/DrummerSpec.ts) and the Blender build alike. See tools/blender/drummer_spec.py.",
